{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Before the parochet of the Sanctuary.</b> And regarding the communal sin-offering it is written: את פני הפרכת, and 'of the Sanctuary' is not written — to tell you that on account of the sin of the anointed priest the Shekhinah did not depart, but when the community sins the Shekhinah departs."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:48.412113204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}